  { number := 102, text := "" },
  { number := 103, text := "The field that selects which language's tables the following payload indices hit. LanguageID values remain as specified in `0004_SSSSS.md` and `0005_CATE.md`. One language keeps one LanguageID. A dialect does not get a different LanguageID. A dialect spelling is not a language change." },
