  { number := 158, text := "## 4. Core clauses" },
  { number := 159, text := "" },
  { number := 160, text := "### 4.1 Relation to CATE" },
  { number := 161, text := "" },
  { number := 162, text := "1. A conforming Anunnaki encoder MUST treat CATE WordID and LanguageID as catalog identity." },
  { number := 163, text := "2. A conforming Anunnaki encoder MUST treat page index as a rank of a WordID, not as a replacement WordID. Variations of spelling MUST be an isomorphism between vocabulary dictionary tables for one language. Different tables MUST be maintained. The frequency ranked word number MUST stay the same across those tables." },
  { number := 164, text := "3. Adding a token to the catalog MUST be recorded as a CATE event." },
  { number := 165, text := "4. Moving a lemma from one page to another MUST be recorded as an Anunnaki migration and MUST satisfy Clause 4.7." },
  { number := 166, text := "5. This document MUST NOT publish a numbered Vocabulary file. That ban remains `0005_CATE.md`." },
  { number := 167, text := "6. This document MUST NOT replace `0005_CATE.md`." },
  { number := 168, text := "" },
  { number := 169, text := "### 4.2 Relation to SSSSS" },
  { number := 170, text := "" },
  { number := 171, text := "1. A language run as specified in `0004_SSSSS.md` MAY be serialized with Anunnaki Encoding." },
  { number := 172, text := "2. A LanguageID prefix MUST appear when the language changes, including at the start of a stream, as specified in `0004_SSSSS.md` Clause 4.1 item 2. A dialect spelling is not a language change. A dialect MUST NOT get a different LanguageID." },
  { number := 173, text := "3. Neural proposals that arise from attending Anunnaki ranks MUST be reduced to sequential LanguageID and WordID values before acceptance, as specified in `0004_SSSSS.md` Clause 4.4." },
  { number := 174, text := "4. The symbolic interface MUST perform decode when the header, the tables, and the payload are well formed. The neural path MUST NOT be required for that decode." },
  { number := 175, text := "5. This document MUST NOT be read as a second SSSSS specification. This document MUST NOT replace `0004_SSSSS.md`." },
